  "title": "Piedmont Natural Gas awards nearly $60,000 in grants to combat hunger, housing insecurity in the Charlotte region",
  "summary": "As part of its efforts to power the vitality of the communities it serves, Piedmont Natural Gas, through the Duke Energy Foundation, has awarded nearly $60,000 in grants to support the missions of three organizations combating hunger and housing insecurity in Charlotte and the surrounding area.",
